.\" Man page for himalaya-mcp-doctor
.\" Generated: July 2026
.TH HIMALAYA-MCP-DOCTOR 1 "July 2026" "himalaya-mcp 1.8.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
himalaya-mcp\-doctor \- Diagnose himalaya-mcp installation and per-account connectivity
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B himalaya-mcp doctor
[\fIflags\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Runs a comprehensive diagnostic suite across the full himalaya-mcp
installation stack. Checks are grouped by category and reported
with pass (\fB✓\fR), warn (\fB!\fR), and fail (\fB✗\fR) indicators.
.PP
If a check fails, the
.BR --fix
flag can auto-resolve common issues.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --account \fIname\fR
Run the per-account reachability probe for the named account only.
By default, all configured accounts are probed in parallel.
.TP
.B --fix
Auto-fix common issues:
.RS
.IP \(bu
Create the Claude Desktop extension settings file with defaults.
.IP \(bu
Set
.B user_config.himalaya_binary
to the
.BR which himalaya
result.
.IP \(bu
Remove stale Claude Code plugin cache directories.
.RE
.TP
.B --json
Emit a single JSON array of all check results instead of the
human-readable tree. Each entry has
.BR name ,
.BR category ,
.BR status ,
.BR message ,
and
.B fixAvailable
fields.
.SH CHECK CATEGORIES
.SS Prerequisites
.TP
.B Node.js
Requires version 22 or later.
.TP
.B himalaya CLI
Must be on
.BR PATH .
.TP
.B himalaya config
Expected at
.B ~/.config/himalaya/config.toml
(warn if missing).
.SS MCP Server
.TP
.B dist/index.js
The bundled MCP server must exist (warn if missing).
.SS Email
.TP
.B Default account
The
.B himalaya account list
output must be parseable.
.TP
.B Folder listing\fR, \fBEnvelope listing
IMAP connectivity via
.B himalaya folder list
and
.B envelope list .
.SS Desktop Extension
.TP
.B Extension installed\fR, \fBmanifest.json
The
.B .mcpb
extension must be unpacked at
.B ~/Library/Application Support/Claude/Claude Extensions/himalaya-mcp/ .
.TP
.B user_config.himalaya_binary
The Claude Desktop extension's
.B himalaya_binary
config must point to a real binary on disk.
.SS Claude Code Plugin
.TP
.B Plugin symlink
The plugin directory at
.B ~/.claude/plugins/himalaya-mcp
must point to the Homebrew-installed copy.
.TP
.B plugin.json\fR, \fBMarketplace registered
The plugin manifest must exist and the plugin must be registered
in
.BR ~/.claude/local-marketplace/ .
.SS Plugin Cache
.TP
.B Plugin cache
Reports stale cache directories at
.B ~/.claude/plugins/cache/himalaya-mcp
and
.B ~/.claude/plugins/cache/local-plugins/himalaya-mcp
if present.
.SS Environment
.TP
.B HIMALAYA_* env vars
Validates that
.BR HIMALAYA_BINARY ,
.BR HIMALAYA_ACCOUNT ,
.BR HIMALAYA_FOLDER ,
and
.B HIMALAYA_TIMEOUT
are not unset template variables.
.SS Accounts
Lists each configured account and reports
.B reachable
or
.B unreachable
with the raw himalaya stderr on failure.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
All checks passed.
.TP
.B 1
At least one check failed. See output for details.
.SH EXAMPLES
Run the full diagnostic:
.RS
.nf
himalaya-mcp doctor
.fi
.RE
.PP
Diagnose one specific account:
.RS
.nf
himalaya-mcp doctor \-\-account work
.fi
.RE
.PP
Auto-fix and re-check:
.RS
.nf
himalaya-mcp doctor \-\-fix
.fi
.RE
.PP
Pipe JSON to jq for machine consumption:
.RS
.nf
himalaya-mcp doctor \-\-json | jq '.[] | select(.status == "fail")'
.fi
.RE
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR himalaya-mcp (1)
.SH AUTHOR
Data-Wise
